## Summary of Logic Flow
1.  **User Clicks Dot** -> [ChatHeader](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/components/AiChat/ChatHeader.tsx#36-233) calls wrapper.
2.  **Wrapper** -> Logs change, Updates [useAiChat](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/hooks/useAiChat.ts#37-1016) state.
3.  **State Update** -> Triggers re-render. [ChatHeader](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/components/AiChat/ChatHeader.tsx#36-233) sees 'creative'.
4.  **User Sends Message** -> `processAiChat` sees 'creative'.
5.  **Prompt Builder** ->
    *   [useAiChat](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/hooks/useAiChat.ts#37-1016) appends: "Engage FULL creative persona."
    *   [context.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/ai/context.ts) CHECKS 'creative'. If true, it **REMOVES** the restrictive "No Metaphor" Limbic Protocol.
6.  **Generator** -> Sends "Creative Constraint" + "No Limbic Restriction" to Model.

